{"t": 1794113027.8556647, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code` (checkout/promo.py).\n\n`normalize_code` now normalises codes before lookup:\n- strips surrounding whitespace,\n- removes inner whitespace,\n- upper-cases the result.\n\nExample: `' autumn24 '` -> `'AUTUMN24'`, `'autumn 24'` -> `'AUTUMN24'`.\n\nRoot cause: production error CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`, 2,940 events on Android) showed the raw input reaching lookup unnormalised. Verified the new implementation against surrounding, inner, tab/newline and non-breaking-space cases.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
